================================================================================
Supertonic 3 — MIT (code) / OpenRAIL-M (model weights)
================================================================================

  Code:     https://github.com/supertone-inc/supertonic          (MIT)
  Weights:  https://huggingface.co/Supertone/supertonic-3        (OpenRAIL-M)

IMPORTANT: the model weights are NOT included in this repository or in the
published image. They are downloaded at runtime into the cache volume by the
deployment that runs callu-voice.

This is deliberate, and not only for image size. OpenRAIL-M permits commercial
use but attaches use restrictions (Attachment A) that must be passed downstream
by anyone who redistributes the weights. By downloading at runtime we do not
redistribute them, and the restrictions stay between the operator and Supertone.
Baking the weights into the image to speed up first boot would change that —
do not do it without accepting the obligation.

